%% Interaction timeline for one ticket
%% Render with: mmdc -i diagrams/sequence.mmd -o diagrams/sequence.svg

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant System as Ticket System
    participant Triage as Triage Agent<br/>(Haiku)
    participant CRM
    participant Tech as Technical Agent<br/>(Sonnet)
    participant Billing as Billing Agent<br/>(Haiku)
    participant KB as Knowledge Base Agent<br/>(Haiku)
    participant Routing as Routing Agent<br/>(Haiku)
    participant Dest as Destination

    Customer->>System: Submits ticket (email / chat / web)
    System->>Triage: New ticket event
    activate Triage
    Triage->>CRM: Look up customer
    activate CRM
    CRM-->>Triage: Tier, plan, account history
    deactivate CRM
    Triage->>Triage: Classify type + urgency, set SLA deadline
    Triage-->>System: Write triage result + audit entry
    deactivate Triage

    Note over Tech,KB: Specialists run at the same time (~3–5 s total, not the sum)

    par Technical analysis (if technical)
        System->>Tech: Ticket + triage context
        activate Tech
        Tech-->>Routing: Diagnosis, severity, suggested fix
        deactivate Tech
    and Billing analysis (if billing)
        System->>Billing: Ticket + triage context
        activate Billing
        Billing-->>Routing: Account status, invoice findings
        deactivate Billing
    and Knowledge base search (always)
        System->>KB: Ticket text
        activate KB
        KB-->>Routing: Best matches + confidence score
        deactivate KB
    end

    activate Routing
    Routing->>Routing: Combine analyses, apply routing rules
    alt P1 outage or enterprise at risk
        Routing->>Dest: Escalate to on-call + team lead
        Dest-->>Customer: "We're on it" + human follow-up
    else KB confidence ≥ 90% and low risk
        Routing->>Dest: Auto-response with KB solution
        Dest-->>Customer: Answer within seconds
    else Everything else
        Routing->>Dest: Assign to Engineering / Finance / L1 with summary
        Dest-->>Customer: Acknowledgement, human reply within SLA
    end
    Routing-->>System: Log routing decision (audit trail)
    deactivate Routing

    Note over System,Dest: In the background, the Escalation Agent re-checks every open ticket<br/>every 5 minutes and escalates any ticket close to its SLA deadline
